Description: Say that a film has no sound when it has a picture and no audio track: the OSD message when the film is loaded and the tooltips of the volume slider and mute button, with the sentence and the rule of the stereo layer's QML module (org.sparky.stereo NoSound). The volume control stays usable.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 579)
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code

